      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "24 · 背景设定操作要点",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-115",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12256,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 114,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "新增先选格式，再选适用尺寸与背景；无边界不需尺寸，有边界先16:9仍可改。空白、横线、点、方格与五线谱可新增时或之後从画布背景选择。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-116",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12348,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 115,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "既有作品应用才提交、取消保留，可Undo；改背景只改纸面，不会改已有笔画与文字颜色。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-117",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
